            "msg_id": "M13",
            "speaker_id": 10272,
            "reply_to": "M12",
            "text": "Writing it down is important so we have a clear baseline. It's the main part of T1. It doesn't have to be a perfect document, just a list of steps with times and notes.",
            "mentions": [
              375944
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
