      {
        "thread_id": "TH3",
        "thread_goal": "Define ergonomic checklist and rotation schedule for the pilot.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M34",
            "speaker_id": 10272,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Let's move on to the ergonomics part of the project: T3 and T4. I've started a draft for the ergonomic checklist (A2). My initial thoughts are including checks for posture, clear floor space, and proper lighting. What else is important from your experience?",
            "mentions": [
              81330,
              87884,
              375944
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T3",
              "T4",
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M35",
            "speaker_id": 81330,
            "reply_to": "M34",
            "text": "Good start. We should add 'tools within easy reach'. A lot of people strain their shoulders reaching for things. My old training in working ergonomically always stressed keeping things in the primary work zone.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "muscle",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M36",
            "speaker_id": 87884,
            "reply_to": "M35",
            "text": "Also, a check on the adjustable stools. People on different shifts leave them at the wrong height. And for Line 4, we must add 'Check hoist mechanism before use'.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M37",
            "speaker_id": 10272,
            "reply_to": "M36",
            "text": "Both great, practical additions. My experience in healthcare showed how much small adjustments can prevent long-term issues. So the list is: \n1. Floor clear of trip hazards\n2. Good lighting\n3. Tools within easy reach\n4. Stool at correct height\n5. Hoist check (for relevant stations)\nDoes this list feel complete but still quick enough to do at the start of a shift?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M38",
            "speaker_id": 375944,
            "reply_to": "M37",
            "text": "What is the correct height for the stool?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 81330,
            "reply_to": "M38",
            "text": "Generally, your feet should be flat on the floor and your knees at about a 90-degree angle. We can add a little diagram for that on the checklist.",
            "mentions": [
              375944
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 10272,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "A diagram is a great idea. Ok, with that clarification, are we ready to lock this list for the pilot checklist A2?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D5"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M41",
            "speaker_id": 87884,
            "reply_to": "M40",
            "text": "Yes, this looks good. It's a solid list.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "white_check_mark",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M42",
            "speaker_id": 10272,
            "reply_to": "M41",
            "text": "Perfect. Now for the rotation schedule, T4. The goal of A3 is to reduce repetitive strain. On Line 4, the main stations are Welding Prep, Main Assembly, and Final Inspection. Any ideas on a pattern?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T4",
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 81330,
            "reply_to": "M42",
            "text": "We could rotate every break?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 87884,
            "reply_to": "M43",
            "text": "That's a good, simple trigger. So, after the first break, everyone moves one station down. Prep -> Assembly, Assembly -> Inspection, Inspection -> Prep. It's easy to remember.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 10272,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "I like that. It's predictable and doesn't require a complex schedule. So we're confirming the rotation pattern will be a clockwise shift between Prep, Assembly, and Inspection after each main break. Are we all in agreement?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D6"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 81330,
            "reply_to": "M45",
            "text": "Works for me.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 10272,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "Decisions made. I'll write up the final A2 checklist and the A3 rotation guide.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2",
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D5",
              "D6"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          }
