            "msg_id": "M64",
            "speaker_id": 10272,
            "reply_to": "M63",
            "text": "I think we need to update the SOP A1 to be more explicit. I propose we add a sub-point under 'Clean Station' that says 'Coil and hang all air and power hoses'. This directly addresses the risk we're seeing.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
